@startuml F4.1e-erro-403
title F4.1e — 403 sem formative.review / escopo de curso
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CAAFController" as Ctrl
participant "AssignFormativeUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

== Cenário A — sem authority ==
Prof -> WebApp: /comissoes/caaf
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /comissoes/caaf
note right of Jwt
  formative.review ausente
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403 access_denied

== Cenário B — escopo de curso ==
Prof -> WebApp: Atribuir item outro curso
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/caaf/atribuicoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT item
Postgres --> UC: fora do curso
UC --> WebApp: 403 course_scope_violation

@enduml
